{
  "subject": "‮You have been invited to ‬⁦⁨فريق Acme⁩⁩‮ on Timlee‬",
  "text": "‮You have been invited to ‬⁦⁨فريق Acme⁩⁩‮ on Timlee‬\n\n⁦⁨owner@example.com⁩⁩‮ has invited you to join ‬⁦⁨فريق Acme⁩⁩‮ as ‬⁦⁨مريم@example.com⁩⁩‮.‬\n\n⁦⁨https://timlee.example/ar-xb/invite?token=secret⁩⁩\n\n‮The invitation expires at ‬⁦06‏/11‏/2026، 9:30 ص⁩‮ (‬⁦⁦7⁩‮ days‬⁩‮ from now) and can only be used once. Sign in with this address to accept it.‬\n\n‮If you were not expecting this, you can safely ignore this email. Nothing happens until you open the link.‬\n",
  "html": "\u003c!doctype html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"ar-XB\" dir=\"rtl\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003ctitle\u003e‮You have been invited to ‬⁦⁨فريق Acme⁩⁩‮ on Timlee‬\u003c/title\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody style=\"font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111;\"\u003e\n  \u003ch1 style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003e‮Join ‬⁦\u003cbdi\u003eفريق Acme\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩‮ on Timlee‬\u003c/h1\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e⁦\u003cbdi\u003eowner@example.com\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩\u003c/b\u003e‮ has invited you to join ‬\u003cb\u003e⁦\u003cbdi\u003eفريق Acme\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩\u003c/b\u003e‮ as ‬⁦\u003cbdi\u003eمريم@example.com\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩‮.‬\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://timlee.example/ar-xb/invite?token=secret\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 16px; background: #111; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;\"\u003e‮Accept the invitation‬\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003e‮Or paste this link into your browser:‬\u003cbr\u003e⁦\u003cbdi\u003ehttps://timlee.example/ar-xb/invite?token=secret\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003e‮The invitation expires at ‬⁦06‏/11‏/2026، 9:30 ص⁩‮ (‬⁦⁦7⁩‮ days‬⁩‮ from now) and can only be used once. Sign in with this address to accept it.‬\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003e‮If you were not expecting this, you can safely ignore this email. Nothing happens until you open the link.‬\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n"
}
